---
<section id="terminal" class="term-cta-section" aria-labelledby="terminal-label">
  <h2 class="eyebrow" id="terminal-label">07 — Terminal</h2>
  <p class="term-cta__copy">
    Everything above, typed instead of scrolled. <span class="term-cta__kw">help</span> to start.
  </p>
  <button class="term-cta" type="button">
    <span class="term-cta__prompt">rajesh@portfolio $</span>
    <span class="term-cta__label">open terminal — or press <span class="term-cta__key">~</span> anywhere</span>
    <span class="term-cta__caret"></span>
  </button>
</section>

<script>
  document.querySelector('.term-cta')?.addEventListener('click', () => window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('rk:open-terminal')));
</script>
